  "description": {
    "text": "The Trainer Collection Gift Box (训练家收藏礼盒) came out on 17 May 2024. Each held a random mini tin showing a trainer with their Pokémon, the matching holo Trainer card, themed sleeves, two five-card Nine Colours Gathering packs (Friend and Origin) and a Final Flame Dance pack. The cards are Raihan, Bea, Leon, Bede, Hop, Marnie and Nessa, each with the trainer's signature printed on it, and a hidden eighth card, a full-art Klara numbered 008 past the set's 7.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Trainer Collection Gift Box and new Dragon Resurgence art sleeve boxes (24 April 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15855.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSIC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 007",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Trainer Collection Gift Box and new Dragon Resurgence art sleeve boxes (24 April 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15855.html"
      }
    ]
  },
